      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRAB A DONUT (8) rocketed out of the inside draw with a strong early sectional and gave a sight but had to settle for a placing, finishing second (19.04) at Q Straight over 350m. Overdue and gets his chance. RISK IT (5) scored an upset win in quick time (19.70) when sent out big odds in a Grade 5 at this track latest. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. BAREFOOT GYPSY (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing seventh (20.65) last time in a Grade 4/5 at Capalaba. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. MCCLUGGAGE (3) comes here off a freshen-up in a suitable contest.",
